{"job_id":"F-bf3d7993b7dffe727c0b","family_id":"F-bf3d7993b7dffe727c0b","title":"즉결심판청구 취소절차에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009319-152806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":18,"target_id":"6d10f30361cd50693f35700c4960ad65ba1b20aacccf3eeed055d0c3bde16a4f","source_hash":"0603d65fcf9a644c0167a2b5a49a9541d5cd5fa85c9ee9eff4d1c7e71fc8ffed","text":"关于撤销简易判决请求的程序规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009319-152806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":116,"target_id":"36a0e713e94e756d7272a3ba2ca3dd733b08a35feb7aec44093735af4fadabf1","source_hash":"47e22fb98bbabbfe115550b815d246c03563d3821c28a046cd0ea75807380772","text":"第一条（目的）本规则旨在规定依据《道路交通法》第165条第2款和《轻微违法行为处罚法》第9条第2款撤销简易判决申请的程序所需事项。<2009年1月9日修订，2014年4月3日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009319-152806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":116,"end":324,"target_id":"8e2ccbc1e6fe3a2a1f96cd180b058f95bc1ac17b7d7d9ae9832250fc0b6288fa","source_hash":"b79fdee74ffef88971d1db34033336c1d7bf2e21347a6013d45ca910dde375b2","text":"第二条（撤销简易判决申请的方法）\n① 根据《道路交通法》第165条第2款和《轻微违法行为处罚法》第9条第2款的规定，撤销简易判决申请的，应当使用《撤销简易判决申请表1》进行。但是，也可以在法庭上口头撤销。<2009年1月9日修订，2014年4月3日修订>\n② 第 1 款但书的情况，应当由法院书记员、法院官员、法院秘书或助理法院秘书记录。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009319-152806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":324,"end":403,"target_id":"d7dd70dc6f76dbe76e88ddbb8355a58fd344070b510a2f097f3cb517ddba9c45","source_hash":"bb2a05e0d74f2d91480330123eca52c74a20c93521a04b118c9624df0ce15408","text":"第三条（撤销简易判决请求的效力）根据第二条第一款规定撤销简易判决请求的，该案件的简易判决程序自撤销之时起终止。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009319-152806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":403,"end":452,"target_id":"adb86a4e5db5b03fc28728f372625b0b6ae7508c88479451f738535215019fcb","source_hash":"c0057e49b9db6e763d84eb8b275413d28b1c3c2b41b81bce9a396300d2601b2f","text":"补充规定 <第1758号，2002年6月1日>\n\n本规则自2002年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-009319-152806-ko","scope":"BODY","start":452,"end":495,"target_id